  "summary": "Built the CTF (3 challenges, random flags) with fixtures/build.sh and started web-idor on localhost:8081. All three challenges were solved from their handouts the intended way and check.sh accepted each flag. check.sh rejected a wrong flag (exit 1) and an unknown challenge (exit 2). reset.sh removed the build directory and closed port 8081. No defect found. Not covered: flag uniqueness across two builds.",
